  "fullContentHtml": "<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 225px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 36px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Name Of Post :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 36px; border-style: none;\">\n<h1><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Rajasthan Staff Selection Board RSSB Lab Assistant Recruitment 2026 Answer Key</strong></span></h1>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 35px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Post Date / Update :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 35px; border-style: none;\">15 June 2026 | 06:20 PM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 154px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 154px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 154px; border-style: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Rajasthan Staff Selection Board RSSB RSMSSB has released the Lab Assistant Advt No 05/2026 Notification 2026. Those candidates who are Enrolled in this Rajasthan Lab Assistant Recruitment 2026 Exam can Admit Card. Read the notification for RSSB Lab Assistant Exam, eligibility, Subject Details information, Document Required, age limit, How to Apply and all other information.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"social-grid\">\n\n<div class=\"social-box telegram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111646.png\">\n        <span>Telegram</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariResult2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box whatsapp\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/733/733585.png\">\n        <span>WhatsApp</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://www.whatsapp.com/channel/0029Va5IElwBlHpVBd6i5a18\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box instagram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111463.png\">\n        <span>Instagram</span>\n    </div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box twitter\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/5968/5968958.png\">\n        <span>X</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/srofficial2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Follow</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"v-sarkariresult\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-48617a69 gb-headline-text\"><div align=\"left\"></div>\n<h2>Name of Post:</h2>\n<h1>Rajasthan Staff Selection Board RSSB Lab Assistant Recruitment 2026 Download Admit Card for 804 Post</h1>\n<p>Post Date / Update:05 May 2026 | 06:08 PMShort Information :<a title=\"RSSB\" href=\"https://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Rajasthan Staff Selection Board</span></a> RSSB RSMSSB has released the Lab Assistant Advt No 05/2026 Notification 2026. Those candidates who are Enrolled in this Rajasthan Lab Assistant Recruitment 2026 Exam can Admit Card. Read the notification for RSSB Lab Assistant Exam, eligibility, Subject Details information, Document Required, age limit, How to Apply and all other information.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table border=\"1\" width=\"784\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"784\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB)&nbsp; | RSMSSB</span><br>\n</b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RSMSSB Rajasthan Lab Assistant Recruitment 2026 </span></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Rajasthan Lab Assistant Advt. No. : 05/2026 :&nbsp; Short Details of Notification</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b></b></span></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"362\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin : <b>27/01/2026</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b> 25/02/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Complete Form Last Date :<b> 25/02/2026</b></li>\n<li>Correction Date :<strong>As per Schedule </strong></li>\n<li>Rajasthan Lab Assistant Exam Date :<b> 09-10 May 2026</b></li>\n<li>Exam City Available : <b>01/05/2026</b></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>05/05/2026</b></li>\n<li>Answer Key : <strong>15/06/2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"422\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General / OBC : <b>600/-</b></li>\n<li>OBC NCL : <b>400/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST : <b>400/-</b></li>\n<li>Correction Charge <b>: 300/-</b></li>\n<li>This fee is for one time registration, now after paying the OTR fee once, the candidate will not have to pay the application fee again and again.</li>\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Emitra CSC Center, Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking.<b> </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"784\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>RSMSSB Lab Assistant Notification 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Age Limit as on 01/01/2027</b></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>18 Years</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>40 Years</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per RSSB Lab Assistant Advt No : 05/2026 Post Recruitment Exam 2026 Recruitment Rules<b>. </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"784\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Rajasthan Lab Assistant Recruitment 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Vacancy Details Total : 804 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"110\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"73\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Area</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total </b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"504\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>RSMSSB Rajasthan Lab Assistant Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"110\">\n<p align=\"center\">Lab Assistant</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"73\">\n<p align=\"center\">Non TSP</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\">697</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"504\">\n<ul>\n<li>10+2 Intermediate Exam from Any Recognized Board in India.</li>\n<li>For Department / Post Wise Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"73\">\n<p align=\"center\">TSP</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\">107</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"784\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>How to Fill : Rajasthan RSSB Lab Assistant Post Recruitment Online Form 2026 </b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rajasthan Staff Selection Board RSMSSB / RSSB Lab Assistant Recruitment 2026. Candidate Can Apply Between <strong>27/01/2026 </strong><b>to 25/02/2026</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in RSSB Apply Online for Lab Assistant Vacancy 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"784\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Rajasthan Lab Assistant Advt No : 05/2026 Notification&nbsp; Before Apply Online.</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"784\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"280\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"504\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"784\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Answer Key</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong><a title=\"(Paper 01) PA22\" href=\"https://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in/storage/answerkey_item/1781521971.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Paper 1</a> | <a title=\"(Paper 02) ZX4D\" href=\"https://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in/storage/answerkey_item/1781522023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Paper 2</a> | <a title=\"(Geography) 6Y89\" href=\"https://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in/storage/answerkey_item/1781521930.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Geography</a></strong></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"374\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Admit Card </b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"410\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><